{"title":"Sandor Lehoczky","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sandor Lehoczky</b>, who is from Alabama, helped start the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mandelbrot_Competition\" title=\"Mandelbrot Competition\">Mandelbrot Competition</a> and co-wrote <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/store/book/aops-vol1\">AoPS Volume 1</a> and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/store/book/aops-vol2\">AoPS Volume 2</a>.  He is married with three children and works for Jane Street Capital in New York City.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sandor_Lehoczky&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Sandor_Lehoczky&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105843\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 286/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.073      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.073      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcach